&lt;p&gt;    Allow fully qualified username to be used for login when principalSuffix is defined&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Adding extra check in ActiveDirectoryGroupRealm for principalSuffix. Now the&lt;br/&gt;
    principalSuffix will be added to username only when the supplied username does&lt;br/&gt;
    not contain any domain name starting with &apos;@&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This will allow AD user authentication with both short &amp;amp; fully qualified user&lt;br/&gt;
    names.&lt;/p&gt;

